  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1269B"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is26">
        <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e98">Caput 26</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_1@1-3">In die illa,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e113">Hoc ad praesentem Ecclesiam potest referri, et ad diem judicii. Nunc Ecclesia canticum novum cantat: Christi nativitatem, passionem, resurrectionem, ascensionem. Vetus namque est antiquum hominem ad inferna descendere; novum, ad coelum ascendere.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_1@10-11">Urbs fortitudinis.</quote>
            Vox justorum, et nunc, et in <pb ed="#P" n="1269C"/> futuro.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e125">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e127">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_2@1-2">Aperite portas.</quote>
            Hoc canticum repente mutat personas.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_2@2-2">Portas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e140"><seg type="qs">Justitiae; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e143" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps117_19@1-4">Aperite mihi portas justitiae.</quote> Portae vitae et justitiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et per multas portas ad eum qui dicit: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e149" source="http://scta.info/resource/io14_6@11-17">Nemo venit ad Patrem nisi per me</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e157">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_3@5-5">Pacem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e164"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e165" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e168">Repetitio confirmatio est. Hanc habet ille de quo dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e170" source="http://scta.info/resource/ez14_4@14-17">Homo homo filiorum Israel</quote>; et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e173" source="http://scta.info/resource/num5_12@9-11">Vir vir cujus uxor cubile maculaverit</quote>, ut duplex homo et duplex vir pacem consequatur duplicem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e181">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_6@1-3">Conculcabit eam pes,</quote>
            etc. Quia <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e188" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc1_48@1-3">Omnis qui se exaltat humiliabitur</quote>. Etiam ad contrarias fortitudines haec referre possumus.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e192">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1269D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e196" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_6@7-7">Egenorum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e199"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e200" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e203">Apostolorum, quos expulerunt Judaei de finibus suis, qui, Domini imitantes paupertatem privilegium virtutis, ejus consecuti sunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e208">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e210">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e212">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e214" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_9@1-3">Anima mea desideravit,</quote>
            etc. Non caro; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e217" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps41_3@1-7">Sitivit anima mea ad Deum fontem vivum</quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e220" source="http://scta.info/resource/gal5_17@1-5">Caro concupiscit adversus spiritum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e225">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e227">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e229">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e231" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_10@1-1">Misereamur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e234"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e235" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e238">Dominus ad prophetam: An misereamur impio, ita ut discat, scilicet clementiam meam, dum ipse salvatur? quasi, hoc melius est.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e241">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e243" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_10@3-5">Et non discet justus,</quote>
            etc. Quasi diceret: Quomodo poterit nosse tuam justitiam, expertus tuam clementiam?
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e247">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e249" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_10@12-14">Et non videbit.</quote>
            Dominus ad prophetam, quasi melius <pb ed="#P" n="1270A"/> est, ut videat, et erubescat de malis suis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e255">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_10@12-14">Et non videbit,</quote>
            quasi diceret: ad poenam sufficit, quia non videbit me regnantem in coelo cum sanctis meis. LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e260">Auferetur impius, ut non videat claritatem Dei.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e264">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e266">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_11@10-11">Confundantur zelantes.</quote>
            LXX: Zelus apprehendet populum ineruditum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e275">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e277">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e279">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e281" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_12@1-2">Domine, dabis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e284"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e285" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e288">Notandum quod postquam opera nostra reddiderit nobis, pacem etiam daturus sit, et quod ideo postulent pacem, quia operatus sit in eis. Dicunt, se, scilicet tormenta, sustinuisse, ut post misericordiam consequantur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e292">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e294">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e296">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e298" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_13@1-4">Domine, possederunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e301"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e302" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e305">Daemones, quos in idolis coluimus. LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e307">Domine, extra te nescimus alium,</quote> non absolute <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e309">alium,</quote> sed <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e311">extra te:</quote> Pater enim in Filio, et Filius in Patre.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e315">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1270B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e319" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_13@9-12">Tantum in te recordemur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e322"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e323" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e326">Non aliud petimus, nisi ut post errores digni simus, qui nominis tui recordemur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e330">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e332">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e334">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e336" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_14@13-14">Perdidisti omnem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e339"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e340" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e343"><seg type="qs">LXX: Masculinum eorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">memoria masculinum interpretatus est contra illud: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e349" source="http://scta.info/resource/gal6_7@1-5">Nolite errare, Deus non irridetur.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e355">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e357">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e359">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e361" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_15@6-6">Nunquid.</quote>
            Non poenitentiam egit, et hoc est: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e364" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_15@6-6">Nunquid,</quote> etc., quasi diceret: Securitas negligentiam, negligentia contemptum parit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e369">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e371">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e373">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e375" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_18@5-6">Et peperimus.</quote>
            Alii distingunt sic: <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e378" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_18@5-12">Et peperimus spiritum, salutem non fecimus in terra.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e382">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e384" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_18@7-8">Spiritum: salute,</quote>
            etc. Ut tota mente credamus, et per quem beneficia non sensimus, per tormenta discamus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is26-Dd1e389">
          <head xml:id="gom-is26-Hd1e391">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is26-d1e393">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e395" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is26_21@16-17">Revelabit terra.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is26-Rd1e398"><name xml:id="gom-is26-Nd1e399" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is26-Qd1e402">Terreni tunc <pb ed="#P" n="1270C"/> non poterunt celare quos occiderunt, quia tunc omnia aperta; vel, terra quae suscepit sanguinem martyrum et operuit, tunc revelabitur quando resurgent.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
